   "source": [
    "# YOLO26m-seg Tuning & Evaluation Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a simplified, modular pipeline to train and evaluate **YOLO26m-seg** on leaf disease segmentation datasets (Rice or Coffee).\n",
    "\n",
    "References:\n",
    "- [YOLO26](https://docs.ultralytics.com/models/yolo26)\n",
    "- [Ultralytics Segmentation](https://docs.ultralytics.com/tasks/segment)\n",
    "- [HuggingFace Upload](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/en/guides/upload)\n",
    "- [ONNX Export for YOLO26 Models](https://docs.ultralytics.com/integrations/onnx)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup, Environment, and Configuration"
